Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:01:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是新转来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the new kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要一点时间来适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just need a little time to settle in.
