Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好像你知道似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你整天待在你的地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spend all your time in your dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,研究你的惊天捕鼠器替代品\N{\fnArial\fs30}working on your ground-breaking mousetrap alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 充满野心和活力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So full of ambition and verve ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我会得到我应得的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm going to get what I deserve ∮
