Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 亲爱的  你知道我们不能输 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, honey You know we just can't lose ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我受不了  所以你别装 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yeah, I can't take it So don't you fake it ∮
