Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我充满野心和活力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm stoked on ambition and verve ∮
