Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好  我们请到了艾什莉·奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up? We got Ashley O in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你的到来  - 谢谢你请我来  忙忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for being here. - Yeah, thank you for having me, Busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的很多歌都是在梦里得到灵感的  真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of your music comes to you in dreams, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  就是在我睡着时出现在我脑子里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, they're kind of in my mind while I'm sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒来后必须马上记下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so when I wake up I have to really quickly write it down
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我不想让它溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I don't want it to just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的歌里宣扬了很多正能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of positive messages in your music,
