Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  必须要让人们觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, it's really important for people to feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能掌控自己的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're in control of their own destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, you know, that means
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要自信自己能成为你想成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}having the confidence to be who you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的姑妈  她很大程度上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, your aunt, she's kind of the source of
