Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据艾什莉·奥的真实个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}An all-new, intelligent companion
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设计的全新智能伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}based on Ashley O's actual personality.
