Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网上都爱死艾什莉替身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love Ashley Too on social.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.95,0:06:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看看你笼中的动物 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ See the animal In her cage you've built ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你确定你是在外面吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Are you sure what side you're on? ∮
