Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一切都在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everything right where ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 应属的地方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It belongs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你看着你的倒影 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you look at your reflection ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那是你所想要的样子吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is it all you want it to be? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你的视线穿透裂缝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you could look Right through the cracks ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:08:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你会发现自己不敢去看吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Would you find yourself afraid to see? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  不是故意打断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, didn't mean to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调子很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nice tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌词有点压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lyrics are kind of a departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么  就是意识流的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing, it's just a stream of consciousness kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.87,0:08:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ashley, everything OK?
