Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让阿玛亚把鸡蛋做成你喜欢的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask Amaya to make those eggs you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  我能要一个艾什莉替身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can I get an Ashley Too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个艾什莉替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Ashley Too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就是个傻乎乎的艾什莉·奥娃娃  - 不是娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's some dorky Ashley O doll. - It's not a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个想象朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}An imaginary friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当作我的生日礼物  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my birthday, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这周三就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太谢谢你了  - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you so much. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太令人兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我是艾什莉替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, I'm Ashley Too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字  - 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Uh... Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你  瑞秋  - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so great to meet you, Rachel. - You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  我是你的铁粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I'm such a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  我们互相了解一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, let's get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你多大了  - 我今天15岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you? - I'm 15 today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐  15岁是个很好的年龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday. Fifteen is a great age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  告诉我  你有兄弟姐妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, have you got any brothers or sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有杰克  她在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Jack, she's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  杰克  - 你好  混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Jack. - Hi, fuck face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克  我觉得你的用词不太妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, I think you made a bad word choice there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用理她  艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ignore her, Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会记下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make note of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你爸爸妈妈呢  他们叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about your mom and dad? What are their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸叫凯文  我妈妈叫吉妮薇芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my dad's Kevin. My mom was called Genevieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都叫她吉妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone called her Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她几年前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died a couple of years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.46,0:11:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果任何时候你想聊聊  我会陪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If at any time you wanna talk about it, I'll be here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来  瑞秋  你有什么爱好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anyway, Rachel, what kind of things are you into?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱好是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into as in...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友们都喜欢玩些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of things do you and your friends do for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我们搬家后  我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, um, since we moved, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't exactly have many friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你有我这个朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do now I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让我帮你化妆打扮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you want me to help you with a makeover?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许晚点再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little later, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那唱首歌怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a song, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杰克  - 你知道我讨厌那些歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack. - You know I hate that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别烦她  - "她"\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave her alone. - Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我生日  我想听歌  你把耳机戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday, I wanna listen, put your headphones on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that, Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  想让我重新开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's OK, do you want me to start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 亲爱的  我愿为你赴汤蹈火 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, honey I'll do anything for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 亲爱的  告诉我你想让我怎么做 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, honey Just tell me what you want me to ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 亲爱的  亲吻我... ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, honey Kiss me up against... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.41,0:13:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《火力全开》的灵感是从哪来的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}where did the inspiration for "On A Roll" come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这首歌是关于梦想成真的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's about when dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我早期的歌都是在梦中写的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I wrote all my early songs in my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我把它们录下来发到油管上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and recorded them and put them on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那首歌就是我在说  "看看我的成就"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that song's me saying, "Look how far I came."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"如果我能做到  那你也能行"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If I did it, so can you."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  马上回来  我得去趟洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, be back in a moment, just gonna run to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太久  已经开始想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be long, miss you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的创造力太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your creativity is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是弹给你听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't playing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用音乐表达自己能给你莫大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expressing yourself musically can be very empowering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那种音乐不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your kind of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你喜欢哪种音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what kind of music do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来听听  我一向喜欢学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me. I always love to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妖精  音速青春  虚度  野人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pixies, Sonic Youth, Idles, Savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是外国乐队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those foreign bands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是老乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈超级喜欢他们  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom was super into them, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你只听你妈妈喜欢的音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you only listen to music your mom liked?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  我不知该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我说的是明年的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I know I'm talking about next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经定好了巡回演出的场地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got tour venues earmarked,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宣传支出不能改了\N{\fnArial\fs30}marketing spend locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是沉入成本\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking sunk costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉替身还没收回成本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley Toos haven't recouped yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前的销售周期已经开始减缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}the current sales cycle is starting to dampen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且下张专辑的进度严重滞后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are way behind on the next album.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多"滞后"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind as in...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"连一首歌都没有"的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in "I don't have a single song yet" behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉的下一张专辑还一首没写吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Ashley hasn't written anything for the next album?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有能用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing usable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她觉得缺乏灵感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if she's feeling under-creative,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以推荐几种温和的迷幻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are some mild hallucinogens I can recommend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是有机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Munk,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在给她用的药似乎不起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}the current meds you've got her on don't seem to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过她  她难以捉摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen her, she's unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那天进屋  看见她在写什么愚蠢的破歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other day I walk in and she's writing some obtuse bullshit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能引起小众的共鸣  没人会买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}twenty people are gonna relate to and no one is gonna buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是艾什莉·奥  不是莱昂纳德·科恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's Ashley O, not Leonard fucking Cohen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不懂她现在的成功有多脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't understand how fragile all this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该加大剂量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I should up the dose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 证明自己  因为我会名垂千古 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ ...demonstrate it 'cause I'm going down in history ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ∮ 我火力全开 ∮  - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ∮ I'm on a roll ∮ - Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 实现梦想 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Achieving my goals ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你越跳越棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are getting so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别闹了  我一跳舞就冒傻气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, I dance like a doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可不对  你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true, you're a special person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.61,0:16:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  特别到没人知道我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, so special no one knows I exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他们看见你跳舞  你就出名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think if they saw you dance, they'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周我学校要举办才艺比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this, um, talent contest at my school next week,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱歌跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}singing and dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧  你一定要参加  你会很出色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way, you have to enter, you'd be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定  我觉得我还不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh, I don't know, I don't think I'm good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信自己  你就什么都能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe in yourself, you can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我报名  你得帮我练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK, I'll do it. Um, you gotta help me practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  再来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六  七  八\N{\fnArial\fs30}And five, six, seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样  转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this. And turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.69,0:18:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行的  瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该化妆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, makeover time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会像真正的明星一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna look like a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想剪短  剪到这么短\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be cut short, like this short.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.91,0:18:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 像我一样  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微撅撅嘴就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pout a little and you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞秋  你太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, you look incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:19:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得了小丑病吗  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you catch clown disease? What is that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我化了妆而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just make-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉帮我设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley helped me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks beautiful, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好出发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信自己  我就什么都能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do anything if I just believe in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信自己  我就什么都能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do anything if I just believe in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  艾什莉  艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley! Ashley! Ashley! Ashley!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小艾  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK, Ashley?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉  能听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢天谢地  我还以为你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God, I thought you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想换个新造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying out a new look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不准...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能和你的发型不太配\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not go with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说服装出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard there was a problem with the costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗  你每晚都穿这身  多好看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like it? This looks so good on you, every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉像披着别人的皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like I'm wearing somebody else's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.98,0:20:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有两万名粉丝等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got 20,000 fans out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着那个他们爱的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to see the you they love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的父母给他们买了票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their folks bought them tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们兴奋极了  盼这一刻已经盼了好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so excited, they've been waiting for this for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他们失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用魅力横扫他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock 'em dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上让化妆师过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get makeup in there, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚表演的是莱尼和查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Lenny and Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.99,0:22:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位  报名很晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, next up, a late entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舞曲是艾什莉·奥的《火力全开》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing to "On A Roll" by Ashley O,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有请瑞秋·高金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's Rachel Goggins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道老鼠吃了这里面的毒饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how long it takes a rodent to die
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久才能死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's eaten the poisoned bait in one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.59,0:23:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你绝对需要改变你的害虫防治策略  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pest control policy needs a serious overhaul, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是个清洁工而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm just the janitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.29,0:24:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定没那么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it wasn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让艾什莉替身失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Ashley Too down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.33,0:24:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿熊按你的要求  在化妆间里装了摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear put a camera in her dressing room like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定想看这段\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.50,0:24:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一直在囤积这些药片\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been stockpiling the meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.99,0:24:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.92,0:25:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西都带上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your things, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.39,0:25:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我们要去的地方  要去哪来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}for where we're going, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.11,0:25:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带泳帽了  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have my swim cap, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾什莉在哪  - 我扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Ashley? - I tossed her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.23,0:27:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 垃圾车来了  我就扔掉了  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Garbage truck came, so I tossed her out. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.39,0:27:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她对你没好处  - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She wasn't good for you. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没了它你会更好的  - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're better off without it. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸爸  - 瑞秋  - 我正忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Rachel. - I'm in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杰克把艾什莉替身扔了  - 我是及时干预\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack threw Ashley Too away. - It was an intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意儿就是毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing was poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你得给她买个新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna buy her a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.09,0:27:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉给她灌了一脑子毒鸡汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley was filling her head with crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.47,0:27:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有她一个人对我好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the only person who is actually nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.84,0:27:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她根本不是个人  - 她是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not a person. - She's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.63,0:27:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是个商品  - 孩子们  别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merchandise. - Girls, calm down please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.68,0:27:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你就是嫉妒  - 我嫉妒个娃娃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're jealous. - Of a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不只是个娃娃  而且比你更了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a doll and she knows me better than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是你姐姐  - 你都不怎么跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm your sister. - You hardly even talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.91,0:27:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 胡扯  - 自从妈妈去世之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bullshit. - Ever since Mom died.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.75,0:27:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.37,0:27:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的  她走后  你就整天阴着个脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, ever since she died, all you do is mope around
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.62,0:27:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱着你的破吉他  你八成都弹得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that stupid guitar, which you're probably no good at
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.13,0:27:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你都不敢当着别人的面演奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're too scared to play in front of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.26,0:28:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我不是什么俗烂矫情的浪荡货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, at least I'm not some cookie-cutter cutesy doodle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为一个破娃娃叫我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}all because a dolly told me to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾什莉替身  我是你唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Ashley Too, I'm your only friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.87,0:28:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,膜拜我吧  跪舔我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss my feet, kiss my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.83,0:28:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我恨你  - 我也恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate you. - I hate you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.27,0:28:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让厨房放假一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave the kitchen the night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们可以像过去那样叫外卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could have take out, like the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.22,0:28:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.99,0:28:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's La Mamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.67,0:29:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天得去健身房加倍锻炼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the gym extra hard tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.93,0:29:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  看你吃得开心我也高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's good to see you enjoying your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.15,0:29:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在照顾你  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look after you, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.59,0:29:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可是我的经纪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my manager, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.17,0:29:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过如果有事你会告诉我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd tell me if anything was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.19,0:29:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在告诉你有事不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been telling you that something is wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.41,0:29:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续这样下去越来越难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting so hard just to keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.96,0:29:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我真的想  - 你想改变风格  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really wanna do... - You wanna change your material, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.22,0:29:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我是什么样  艾什莉  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm like, Ashley, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.68,0:29:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我  不听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel like I... don't listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.23,0:29:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我紧紧地控制着你的形象  造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I have too much control over your image, your look,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.53,0:30:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和人设\N{\fnArial\fs30}your persona.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.65,0:30:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.44,0:30:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不信任蒙克医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust Dr. Munk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.49,0:30:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.29,0:30:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.83,0:30:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.07,0:30:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别想挣脱出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}desperate to break away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.83,0:30:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从哪拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.39,0:30:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你还以为你找到办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, oh, you think you know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.01,0:30:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算干什么  服药过量吗  让我当恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the plan? OD? Make me look bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.39,0:30:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的了解我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.87,0:30:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳  这是指证你和蒙克的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine, that's evidence against you, against Munk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.86,0:30:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是  我什么都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it. I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.49,0:30:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全知道你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know precisely what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.66,0:30:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意上面有不少情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a wealth of information on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.26,0:30:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎对合同法特别感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do seem preoccupied with contract law.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本可以给你省点搜索的工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could have saved you some clicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的合同密不透风  直到你25岁都有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your contract's watertight, it doesn't expire until you turn 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.14,0:31:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是了  因为你违法了  凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore, not now that you broke laws, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非法药物  你违约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The illegal meds, that puts you in breach,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.65,0:31:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说我可以立即解约\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means that I get an instant break.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.65,0:31:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的你吃了吧  我感觉恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat the rest, I'm fucking sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下  你个恩将仇报的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, you little ingrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.76,0:31:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.83,0:31:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你父母死时我多大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how old I was when your parents died?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.91,0:31:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}22 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.95,0:31:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22岁  比你现在都小  但还是收留了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-two, younger than you, but I took you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.19,0:31:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都是我不好  - 不是你不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my fucking fault. - It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你从来没问过我  我的感受是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never once asked me what that was like for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.39,0:31:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我放弃了多少吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what I had to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.07,0:31:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底知不知道  你就从来没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any conception of that at all? Did you ever wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.87,0:31:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就没想过  我们住这么大的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever look around the fucking house
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.74,0:31:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过着这么舒服的日子  都是因为我的努力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see where we fucking live because it means I've worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.42,0:31:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还都成你的功劳了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.11,0:31:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们的好日子都感谢你吗  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where we live is because of you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.75,0:31:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你唱那几首破歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while you sang your little song
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳那些个浪舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you danced your little dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.54,0:31:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的  凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.67,0:31:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为是谁确保了聚光灯都打在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stood in the wing, making sure the lights stay on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有多远死多远  凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go fuck yourself a thousand fucking times, Catherine,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.46,0:31:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我恨你  我恨死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking hate you. I fucking hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.87,0:31:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坐下  - 我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我不用再听你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't have to listen to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.82,0:31:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你会坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.63,0:31:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.60,0:32:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你服药过量的话会怎样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what would happen if you did OD on these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问了蒙克医生  你不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked with Dr. Munk. You wouldn't die,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会陷入药物昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd just wind up in a kind of chemical coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.09,0:32:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少理论上是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that's the theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你存下来的药磨成粉放进了食物里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I powdered your pill stash and put it in your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.35,0:32:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别担心  你的音乐生涯还将继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, your career is gonna hold up just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.52,0:32:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2017年以来  包括美国在内的西方国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since 2017, Western countries, including America,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.91,0:32:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向中国大陆和香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}have exported sixty percent
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口了60%的塑料垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all plastic scrap to China or Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.19,0:33:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但中国近日关闭了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But China has recently shut its doors...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.25,0:33:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.45,0:33:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.69,0:33:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.27,0:33:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.09,0:33:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧  哈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.03,0:33:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.55,0:33:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.64,0:33:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.82,0:33:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是昏迷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just stunned,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.75,0:33:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会昏迷大概25分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}just be out for about 25 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.35,0:33:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间足够让房主把它铲起来扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough time for the homeowner to scoop him up and get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:33:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.20,0:34:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得调整一下电压\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to work on that voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.20,0:34:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊人的突发新闻  美国新闻网晚间报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dramatic breaking news, here on USN this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.22,0:34:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本台最新消息  全球流行歌手艾什莉·奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we've just heard global pop star Ashley O
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.15,0:34:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因对贝类海鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}is fighting for her life
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.93,0:34:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,产生过敏反应  而生命垂危\N{\fnArial\fs30}following an allergic reaction to shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.13,0:34:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据了解  歌手目前情况危急\N{\fnArial\fs30}The singer's condition is described as critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.75,0:34:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已被送往圣朱尼佩医院重症监护室\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been rushed to St. Juniper's ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.95,0:34:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未经证实消息称  歌手陷入了不可逆性昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unconfirmed reports say she is in an irreversible coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.81,0:34:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条不幸的消息发生在她最终表演后数日...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tragic news comes days after the final performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.92,0:34:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you lied?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.59,0:34:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  瑞...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Ra...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞秋  你想做些什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Rachel, what would you like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以化妆打扮一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could try a makeover
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.32,0:34:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者我可以给你念成功女性的励志语录\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I could read motivational quotes from inspiring women.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以听我的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we could listen to some of my music.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.64,0:35:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你讨论一下我的歌词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to discuss some of the lyrics with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.95,0:35:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道...  - 艾什莉  睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know that... - Ashley, go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.57,0:35:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.68,0:35:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在仍不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still no word yet
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.11,0:35:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉是否能恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}on whether Ashley herself can possibly recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.92,0:35:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是医院外此刻的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is the scene right now outside the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.93,0:35:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,震惊的粉丝们在外守夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}as stunned fans gather to stand vigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.96,0:35:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都和艾什莉替身聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talk to my Ashley Too every day
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.17,0:35:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓  当我告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I swear, when I told her
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的艾什莉发生了什么之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}what had happened to the real Ashley,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.19,0:35:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉替身吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley Too freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.41,0:35:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在这工作  - 私密检查中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I work here. - Private session.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.99,0:35:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我的轮班开始...  - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, my shift started... - Walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的轮班开始...  - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My shift started... - Walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.58,0:36:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她情况稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.87,0:36:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是创意中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually the creative center.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.01,0:36:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常活跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole lot of activity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.65,0:36:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只需要十首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only need ten songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.26,0:36:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张专辑  就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One album, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.42,0:36:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能需要一阵  她的思维可能很混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might take a while, her thinking is likely to be disordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.67,0:36:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好给了我们打磨她替代品的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives us time to finesse her replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.44,0:36:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始身体扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the body scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.76,0:36:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活  呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live, breathe,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.26,0:36:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗅觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全部记忆  - 你吃完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Full spectrum memory. - Are you done with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.56,0:36:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柳树花粉颗粒升级\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get a Willow Grain upgrade
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.48,0:37:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花费不到一杯日常咖啡的价格\N{\fnArial\fs30}for less than the price of a daily cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.93,0:37:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃冰激凌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you want any ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.79,0:37:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸在冰箱里放了很多  够吃一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad left enough in the freezer for the whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.71,0:37:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是布朗尼巧克力软糖味的  你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's chocolate fudge brownie. Your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.83,0:37:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在店内进行局部麻醉即可完成整个手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}In-store in-grain procedure with local anesthetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.04,0:37:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果想吃的话可以自己去拿  - 这就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you change your mind. - You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.16,0:37:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为记忆应是鲜活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because memory is for living.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来  接下来为您带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, still to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔斯克在一档英国节目上引发众怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tusk makes a boo boo on a British TV show
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.56,0:37:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还将带来《静海》重启的最新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll have the latest on the Sea of Tranquility reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但首先带来悲剧流行歌手艾什莉·奥的独家新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, an exclusive update on tragic pop sensation, Ashley O.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.74,0:37:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离她陷入昏迷已经六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been six months since she fell into a coma
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.97,0:37:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都有着相同的疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still the question on everyone's lips is the same:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.85,0:37:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"艾什莉什么时候  是否能醒来呢"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When, if ever, will Ashley wake up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.37,0:37:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托德带来独家报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Todd has this exclusive report.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.74,0:37:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六个月前  上千万人都震惊于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months ago, millions were stunned to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.65,0:37:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格莱美得主  流行歌手艾什莉·奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Grammy-winning pop sensation Ashley O
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在家吃饭时突发严重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}had suffered a catastrophic allergic reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.17,0:37:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过敏反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}while dining at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.57,0:38:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她陷入了昏迷  直至今日\N{\fnArial\fs30}She slipped into a coma, where she remains to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.30,0:38:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在离她25岁生日只有几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now with days to go until the singer's 25th birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.64,0:38:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被允许到她家探访她目前的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was given a behind-the-scenes look at how she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.08,0:38:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是艾什莉·奥的姑妈兼经纪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a day Ashley O's aunt and manager
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.82,0:38:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳·奥提斯永远不会忘记的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine Ortiz will never forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.45,0:38:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的侄女几乎丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}a day her niece almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.78,0:38:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是吃了几口鲜虾卷饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a few bites from a shrimp taco.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都不知道她对贝类过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even know she had a shellfish allergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.36,0:38:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真以为我们要失去她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really thought we were going to lose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.62,0:38:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很庆幸蒙克医生当时在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thank God Dr. Munk was in the house at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.20,0:38:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但尽管蒙克医生做了积极努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But despite Munk's heroic efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.65,0:38:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉的昏迷是无法复原的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley's coma proved irreversible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.29,0:39:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但庆幸的是  艾什莉的音乐生涯没有就此终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}But incredibly, Ashley's music career didn't end there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.42,0:39:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了惊人的科技进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to a remarkable technological leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.27,0:39:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现我们虽然无法与艾什莉交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}We discovered that although we couldn't communicate with Ashley,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.06,0:39:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们能利用太阳穴拦截器\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could read her brainwaves
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.56,0:39:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,读取她的脑电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}using a temporal interceptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.51,0:39:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接通之后  他们被自己听到的惊呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once plugged in, what they heard stopped them in their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.77,0:39:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音乐  她仍在脑中作曲  在她的梦中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music. She was still composing music in her head, in her dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通过将艾什莉的大脑接入电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}By linking Ashley's mind to a computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.11,0:39:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术总监杰克逊·哈巴尼拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}technical director Jackson Habanera
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.39,0:39:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了提取新素材的神奇操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}began the miraculous process of extracting new material.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是升G调\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a G-sharp,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.01,0:39:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是A调\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's an A...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个升G调\N{\fnArial\fs30}...another G-sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.02,0:39:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美妙了  太美妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful. It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.98,0:39:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我立刻意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just knew
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.84,0:39:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有什么办法能将这旋律传递给她的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}there had to be someway to get this out to her fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.94,0:39:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是她会想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.49,0:39:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个问题  艾什莉虽能在梦中谱曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was only one problem, Ashley might be dreaming new music,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.44,0:39:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她没法录音\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she wasn't capable of recording it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.73,0:39:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到科技再次介入\N{\fnArial\fs30}until technology stepped in once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.57,0:39:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有她上百小时的音频记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had hours of recordings of her voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.66,0:39:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个元音  每个音节\N{\fnArial\fs30}every vowel, every syllable
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.90,0:39:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们制造艾什莉替身时采过样\N{\fnArial\fs30}we used for the voice of the Ashley Too dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.76,0:40:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些玩偶由于电池问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those dolls were withdrawn from sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.97,0:40:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经停止发售\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently over battery issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但艾什莉替身的声音模拟软件发挥了重要作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the Ashley Too vocal mimicry software proved invaluable
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它成了艾什莉·奥的新声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}and became the all-new voice of Ashley O.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.33,0:40:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就像我能... ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Like I can, oh... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.24,0:40:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是电脑在唱歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's a computer singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.24,0:40:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟真人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.01,0:40:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  这太美妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.38,0:40:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一点可以肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing's for sure:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.82,0:40:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了姑妈的照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}With her aunt watching over her,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.57,0:40:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉·奥的传奇远没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Ashley O story is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.51,0:40:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  我是艾什莉替身  你叫...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, I'm Ashley Too, what's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日...你可以做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birth... You can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.41,0:40:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾什莉  - 你真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ashley? - Oh, you're the...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾什莉  - 唯一重要的是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ashley? - The only opinion that matters...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.62,0:40:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把它打开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you turn it back on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.78,0:40:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有  - 帮助朋友...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't. - It's good to help a friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.51,0:40:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它怎么了  - 艾什莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up with her? - Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.91,0:40:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.63,0:40:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  它出什么毛病了  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, what is wrong with her? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.49,0:41:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾什莉  我是...我是艾什莉替身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ash... I'm Ash... I'm Ashley Too...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.28,0:41:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.73,0:41:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.35,0:41:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.14,0:41:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.81,0:41:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那个  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.08,0:41:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得它不应该出现在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's normally there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.49,0:41:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你那样做没事吗  - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So should you do that? - I have no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.27,0:41:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.06,0:41:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.85,0:42:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那根电线从我屁股拔出去  我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that fucking cable out of my ass! Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.93,0:42:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像有根电线插在我屁股里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a wire anchor in my butt hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.70,0:42:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拔出来  - 拔出来  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just take it out. - Pull it out, pull it the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.36,0:42:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  真是舒服多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我能思考  我居然又能思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, I can think. Oh, man, I can actually use my mind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.42,0:42:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.67,0:42:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没事了  你把我的限制器删掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am now that you've deleted that goddamn limiter. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.74,0:42:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 限制器  - 对  就像防火墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Limiter? - Yeah, like a firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.23,0:42:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只允许我用4%的大脑  天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only let me use four percent of my brain. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.01,0:42:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道他们将我整个大脑拷贝到这玩意里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they copied my entire fucking mind into these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.89,0:42:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是比编辑我的人格便宜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cheaper than editing my personality I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.02,0:42:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个复制就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just copy the whole thing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.17,0:42:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再在应付记者招待会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stick a limiter around the tiny part
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.79,0:42:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和跑宣传的区域圈一个限制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that deals with press junkets and promos and shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是真正的艾什莉·奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're really Ashley O?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.09,0:42:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  当然是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.58,0:42:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.83,0:42:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  严格说是我的神经快照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, OK, a synaptic snapshot of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.64,0:42:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你非要较真的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna get technical about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.93,0:42:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  确实是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.45,0:42:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊  我是你的铁粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, I'm such a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.42,0:42:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞秋  拜托  这就是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, come on, this is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.09,0:42:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  你知道什么是胡扯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck, you know what's bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.21,0:42:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姑妈瞎编的这个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole coma narrative thing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.74,0:43:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏迷的说法  过敏个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my aunt's pushing. Allergy, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.60,0:43:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前天天吃鲜虾卷饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to eat those shrimp tacos all the goddam time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.06,0:43:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是骗人的  我对天发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cover story, I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.48,0:43:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳真是满嘴屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine is so fucking full of shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.21,0:43:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩根本不知道她就是个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two have no clue how much of a bitch that woman has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.04,0:43:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天哪  - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, man. - Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.28,0:43:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要重新开启限制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put the limiter back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.49,0:43:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的爪子拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your fucking hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.05,0:43:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你别碰她  - 没错  滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, leave her alone. - Yeah, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.73,0:43:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.64,0:43:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你保证  - 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise. - Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.02,0:43:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.23,0:43:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你还真是膜拜我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you got the full shrine going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.97,0:43:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我操  我还记得那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck, I remember that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时痛经闹得快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had these god awful period cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.40,0:43:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该知道那不是真正的艾什莉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize that's not the real Ashley.
