Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.81,0:59:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是不是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't she great?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.41,0:59:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永恒艾什莉是历史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley Eternal is the most accurate
