Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.92,0:59:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 杰克  你知道怎么去场馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Jack, do you know the way to the stadium?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.49,0:59:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.59,0:59:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.54,0:59:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  不仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.92,0:59:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什莉还能随意伸缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley is also fully scalable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.84,0:59:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"随意伸缩"  可伸又可缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I say, "Scalable," I mean scalable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.44,1:00:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不用从远处眯着眼睛看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more squinting from half a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.93,1:00:05.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在所有观众都将享受前排的豪华视效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the entire audience gets a front row seat,
