Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.48,1:00:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.89,1:00:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一场演出能让现场观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}an act that will make the live audience
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.79,1:00:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下他们的破手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}put down their damn phones,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.31,1:00:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬头向前  惊得说不出话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}look up, and gasp in awe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.44,1:00:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 红灯闯过去  - 我才不要闯红灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to jump the light. - I'm not jumping a red.
