Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.28,1:00:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.95,1:00:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警察来了  - 我永远拿不到驾照了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit, it's the cops. - I'm never gonna get my license.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.04,1:00:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.58,1:00:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永恒艾什莉可以线上播放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley Eternal is streamable.
