Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.91,1:00:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会疲惫  不会生病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never exhausted, never sick,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.05,1:01:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声调永远完美  状态永远最佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}always pitch perfect, bringing her A-game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.32,1:01:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不再是梦  而是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a dream, it's reality.
